{
  "_readme": [
    "SEED ONLY. Applied once, when the sector table is empty — a fresh install must not be a",
    "blank product. After that the table is the source of truth and this file is history: the",
    "platform console edits sectors at RUNTIME (/api/v1/platform/sectors), with no rebuild and no",
    "restart. Re-applying this on every boot would silently undo an operator's edits, which is the",
    "worst kind of bug — the console appears to work, and the change is gone by morning.",
    "",
    "FOUR SECTORS, and the first one is wider than its name suggests. A Saudi بنشر is not a tyre",
    "shop in the western sense: it is the neighbourhood quick-service centre. The same man who",
    "patches a puncture also changes the oil, flushes the gearbox, washes the engine, swaps the",
    "battery, replaces the cabin filter and tops up the aircon. Modelling it as tyres-only would",
    "have produced a service grid that its own owner could not use — and he would have concluded,",
    "correctly, that this product was not built for his trade.",
    "",
    "`cycle_days` is what reminders schedules from. 0 means NO natural cycle — a puncture repair, a",
    "one-off makeup booking — and generates no reminder. Explicitly a value rather than a missing",
    "one: defaulting it to 30 would schedule a reminder for a puncture and teach a customer that our",
    "messages are noise.",
    "",
    "No prices. They vary by city, by shop and by the day; shipping a number ships a wrong one to",
    "almost everybody, and a wrong price on a screen is worse than a blank one.",
    "",
    "EVERY SECTOR ENDS WITH `خدمة أخرى`, and it is not filler. A technician does something the",
    "catalogue does not list; a POS sends a service the owner never added. Without a catch-all the",
    "operator CANNOT SAVE — and the visit is lost, which loses the customer from the system",
    "entirely: no reminder, no points, no metric. Losing the service name is a small cost; losing",
    "the visit costs the product its premise.",
    "",
    "cycle_days is 0 on it, necessarily: we do not know what was done, so we cannot say when it is",
    "due again. It records the visit and generates no reminder."
  ],
